# {{projectName}}

Built with Astro — Content-Focused Site.

## Stack
- **Framework:** Astro (static output)
- **Language:** TypeScript
- **Content:** Astro Content Collections (Markdown/MDX)
{{#if useTailwind}}
- **Styling:** Tailwind CSS 4
{{/if}}
{{#if useMdx}}
- **MDX:** Enabled
{{/if}}

## Content Collections
Content lives in `src/content/` as Markdown/MDX files with type-safe schemas.
{{#each modules}}
- **{{pascalCase this}}** — `src/content/{{this}}/`
{{/each}}

## Commands
```bash
npm run dev      # Start dev server (port 4321)
npm run build    # Build static site
npm run preview  # Preview production build
{{#if useTests}}
npm test         # Run tests
{{/if}}
{{#if useE2E}}
npm run test:e2e # Run E2E tests
{{/if}}
{{#if useLint}}
npm run lint     # Lint code
npm run format   # Format code
{{/if}}
```

## Project Structure
```
src/
  content/        # Content collections (Markdown/MDX)
    {{moduleName}}/
      first-post.md      # Sample content
    config.ts             # Collection schemas (Zod)
  layouts/         # Page layouts
    BaseLayout.astro      # Root HTML shell
  pages/           # Astro pages (file-based routing)
    index.astro           # Home page
    {{moduleName}}.astro         # {{pascalCase moduleName}} listing
    {{moduleName}}/
      [...slug].astro     # Dynamic post pages
  components/      # Shared .astro components
  styles/          # Global CSS
```
